            <div class="process-content">
              <h3 class="title"><span>02</span>. Design & Planning</h3>
              <p>We begin by understanding <br /> your vision, goals, and needs, <br /> followed by our expert team.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="number">02</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-xl-3 col-lg-6 col-md-6">
          <div class="process-item fade-top">
            <div class="process-thumb">
              <img src="/assets/img/images/process-img-3.webp" alt="process" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <div class="process-content">
              <h3 class="title"><span>03</span>. Implementation</h3>
              <p>We begin by understanding <br /> your vision, goals, and needs, <br /> followed by our expert team.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="number">03</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-xl-3 col-lg-6 col-md-6">
          <div class="process-item fade-top">
            <div class="process-thumb">
              <img src="/assets/img/images/process-img-4.webp" alt="process" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <div class="process-content">
